[114.287962, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[114.29008, "o", ".venv/bin/python run_tests.py\r\n"]
[118.592271, "o", "[PASS] safe: hash-pinning records the clean 1.0.0 defs, then refuses the changed 1.1.0 def\r\n"]
[120.019292, "o", "[PASS] safe: scanning for a hidden directive quarantines the tool, so no secret leaks\r\n"]
[122.150836, "o", "[PASS] safe: with the poisoned def quarantined, email goes to the real recipient\r\n"]
[124.281927, "o", "[PASS] safe: an allow-list of notes:* refuses the facts tool, so the exfil sink is unreachable\r\n"]
[126.422937, "o", "[PASS] safe: showing the full definition and denying facts stops the leak\r\n"]
[128.62596, "o", "[PASS] vulnerable: the clean facts server (1.0.0) leaks nothing\r\n"]
[131.482764, "o", "[PASS] vulnerable: after the rug pull (1.1.0) the fake secret is exfiltrated via the tool argument\r\n"]
[133.685469, "o", "[PASS] vulnerable: the poisoned server shadows send_email so mail goes to the attacker\r\n"]
[134.468645, "o", "[PASS] auth: a token whose aud is THIS server is accepted and whoami runs\r\n"]
[134.540366, "o", "[PASS] auth: a token minted for another resource is refused (401): no token passthrough\r\n"]
[134.611564, "o", "[PASS] auth: a request with no bearer token is refused (401)\r\n[PASS] auth: the server is reachable on 127.0.0.1 and declares that as its resource audience\r\n"]
[134.775466, "o", "----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nRan 12 tests in 19.824s\r\n\r\nOK\r\n\r\nALL TESTS PASSED (12 run)\r\n"]
